.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE RENAME"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute rename \- Rename a definition without changing its stable key or type
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute rename [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rename a definition without changing its stable key or type
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
New display name
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
